OL,3,GNEWSAAI camera targeting U-turns at
OL,4,Acrash hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA camera that uses artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence technology to detect
OL,8,Fdangerous U-turns has been installed at
OL,9,Fa crash hotspot.
OL,11,FVision Zero South West, a road safety
OL,12,Fpartnership involving 17 different
OL,13,Forganisations, said the camera on the
OL,14,FHayle bypass section of the A30 in
OL,15,FCornwall was the first of its kind to
OL,16,Fbe used in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
