OL,3,GNEWSAAI camera targeting U-turns at
OL,4,Acrash hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the camera was installed by
OL,7,FNational Highways in partnership with
OL,8,FDevon and Cornwall Police and Cornwall
OL,9,FCouncil at a spot where 10 crashes
OL,10,Finvolving U-turns had happened since
OL,11,F2014 - leading to one death.
OL,13,FAdrian Leisk, head of road safety for
OL,14,Fthe police force, said the device had
OL,15,F"become necessary" as motorists had
OL,16,Fignored a ban on U-turns there.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
